{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "A Day With Vanessa"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "That's What I Thought"}, {"type": "position", "content": 10}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 16}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Use expressions about relationships and feelings in a range of social and work contexts. "}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Using <span class=\"italic\">If</span>, <span class=\"italic\">When</span>, <span class=\"italic\">Before</span> and <span class=\"italic\">After</span> to Talk About the Future"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use time clauses to give information about time and sequence."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use the words <span class=\"italic\">If</span>, <span class=\"italic\">When</span>, <span class=\"italic\">Before</span> and <span class=\"italic\">After</span> in time clauses."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use the first conditional with these time clauses."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">If/When/Before/After</span> + Subject + Simple Present tense, Subject + <span class=\"italic\">will/be going to</span> + Simple Present tense"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Before</span> means at an earlier time."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">After</span> means at a later time."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">Before I go to sleep, I'll set my alarm.<br/>After I set my alarm, I'm going to go to sleep.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">If</span> means on the condition that ..."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">If I go to sleep, I'll set my alarm. (I'm not sure that I'll go to sleep).</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">When</span> means at the time of doing something."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">When I go to bed, I'll set my alarm.</span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Before I do, I'm going to do some research."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Before you blog about it, I'll send you pictures."}, {"type": "example", "content": "If he asks you again, are you going to go?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "When I get the pictures, I'll call you if I have any questions."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Asking for Clarification"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You ask for clarification when you want more details of what the other person is talking about. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "You ask for clarification when it is not clear what the other person is referring to. You ask the other person to be more specific by giving you more information. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Questions within sentences are called <span class=\"strong\">embedded questions</span>. <br/>An embedded question is a question included in another question or statement."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">Example: </span><br/><span class=\"strong\">Simple question</span>: <span class=\"italic\">What are you going to do after dinner?</span><br/><span class=\"strong\">Embedded question</span>: <span class=\"italic\">Do you know what you're going to do after dinner?</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Embedded questions are usually used to make your question or comment sound softer or more polite."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Could you tell me what you mean by that?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Can you remind me where the club is?"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "for the most part"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "in most cases; usually"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: They were well-dressed, for the most part."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le16ob10aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about feelings and reactions."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to unwind"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to relax"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I think his job is stressing him out ... he needs nights like these to unwind."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le16ob10aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "disco ball"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a round, shiny ball used in nightclubs to reflect lights"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: One thing I really liked about Shimmer is that they have a huge disco ball."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le16ob10aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "laser show"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a light show using lasers"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: They had a laser show at the club!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le16ob10aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "bar"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a part of a restaurant or club that sells drinks"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Let's just say the bar made great money!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le16ob10aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "go-go dancer"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a dancer who entertains crowds at nightclubs"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There were also go-go dancers upstairs! "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le16ob10aud06"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn7le16ob10re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Think about what kind of dance club you like."}, {"type": "text", "content": "If you owned a dance club, what would it have in it?"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write down all things that you want to put in a dance club."}, {"type": "text", "content": "With a partner, design a dance club and create a poster advertisement for it."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Show your poster to other students and tell them why they should come to your club."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "c